What each one does
1. LangGraph (Workflow Manager)

It decides what happens first and what happens next.

Input
   │
Customer Lookup
   │
Retriever
   │
Shipment Tool
   │
Supplier Tool
   │
Weather Tool
   │
Risk Tool
   │
LLM
   │
Output

Purpose: Controls the execution flow.

2. LangChain (AI Framework)

It provides the AI building blocks.

Prompt Template
      │
Tool Calling
      │
Memory
      │
Output Parser
      │
Groq LLM

Purpose: Connects tools, the LLM, prompts, and memory.

3. RAG (Knowledge Retrieval)

It finds relevant information before the LLM answers.

PDF / CSV Documents
        │
Text Splitter
        │
Embeddings
        │
FAISS
        │
Retriever
        │
Relevant Context

Purpose: Supplies accurate company knowledge to the LLM.

