Simple analogy

Imagine running a logistics company:

LangGraph = Operations Manager → decides the sequence of work.
LangChain = Office Staff → communicates with systems, prepares prompts, manages memory, and calls tools.
RAG = Company Knowledge Base → looks up policies and documents before answering.
FAISS = Digital Filing Cabinet → quickly finds the right document.
Groq LLM = AI Analyst → writes the final shipment report.
